  "rationale": "Thirteen40-minute lessons provide separate experiences for notation/equivalence,geometric and component addition,scalar sign/zero,origin-dependent position,magnitude,midpoint,translation,scaled application,audit and independent evidence. All12source outcomes are substantively mapped. Midpoint-of-a-vector wording is interpreted explicitly as midpoint of a displayed directed segment;no free-vector midpoint location is invented. Actual readiness/pacing require teacher confirmation.",
